MangaPixer Windows Installer\par
\par
This installs MangaPixer for the current Windows user only. No system-wide\par
changes are made and no administrator privileges are required. The default\par
install location is %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\MangaPixer; you can choose a\par
different folder on the next screen.\par
\par
Uninstalling removes the installed program files and the sign-in shortcut,\par
but preserves your MangaPixer data (library database, settings, cached\par
covers) under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\MangaPixer.\par
\par
Click Next to continue.\par
